_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1241110009":{"text":"え？どうしてですか？","source_cn":"哎？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x355350A752F32C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241110010:1":{"text":"そうそう。街の周りには畑もほとんどないから、普段はお魚や海の生き物しか食べられないわ。","source_cn":"是呀，锈锚港附近的农田不多，平时能吃到的食物几乎都是鱼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2174BDF97B1F6BBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241110011:1":{"text":"港も封鎖されてるし、お魚以外の食材は軒並み高くなっているはずよ。新鮮な果物や野菜なんて、とんでもなく高いに決まってるわ！","source_cn":"尤其是港口被封锁的这段时间，要想不吃鱼，可是要花很多钱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x639A6B7A4FC783DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241110012:1":{"text":"野菜や果物が食べられない！？\nな、なんて恐ろしい……！","source_cn":"一直吃不到蔬菜和水果？！\\n这……这也太可怕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5318A10F8179CDA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241110013:1":{"text":"そうよ。現地の人たちはもう慣れてるでしょうけど……私たちはとても耐えられないわ。","source_cn":"是呀，对我们来说，真的很可怕。不过本地人似乎早就习惯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB69A1135A803C1F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241110014:1":{"text":"ちなみに、ここではデューラ様の代わりに、浪と漂流の神であるテルミリウス様を信奉する人も少なくないわ。海を司るテルミリウス様の方が漁師たちにとってはありがたいのかもね。","source_cn":"对了，比起艾雅女神，这里也有不少人信仰风浪与漂泊之神特...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE501FAE3CE287D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241110015:1":{"text":"そういえば、漁師がその日に釣れた一匹目のお魚を海に帰すのを見たわ。あれは浪と漂流の神への捧げ物の意味があるの。","source_cn":"我还见到有渔民将每天钓到的第一尾鱼放回溪流和大海，当做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F4FBDFA3F8D18EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241110016:1":{"text":"へえ……まあ、普通の漁師が神に捧げられる物といえば、お魚ぐらいなんだろうけど……","source_cn":"唔……毕竟除了鱼以外，普通的渔民可能也没什么东西能献给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0666D954A8643F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241110017:1":{"text":"金貨を捧げても喜んでくれるのかな？","source_cn":"你说，他会接受金币作为供奉吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7D9E95EBBD80E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241110018:1":{"text":"ん？金の話をしてるのか？何かいい儲け話があるなら教えてくれよ。","source_cn":"嘿，嘿，朋友们，我听到有人在聊钱？有发财的路数吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7472FC35B2E25943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_re